<title>HONG KONG: Continental Holdings year net up sharply.</title>
<headline>Continental Holdings year net up sharply.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.4    vs 1.8</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    12.38  vs 4.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		     456.18 vs 450.41</p>
<p>    Company name		 Continental Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Continental Holdings designs and manufactures jewellery for export.</p>
<p>A change of operational profit of HK$516,000 for the last corresponding year was made due to reclassification of exceptional items for 1994/95 figures.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is nil vs nil.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
